                  "fill": "#385650",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I’m Ramón, a front-end developer, computer engineer and founder of Lead Web. Since 2013, I’ve built websites for businesses and agencies, with a strong connection to Florida.",
