                  "fill": "#526D66",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Today, I combine that experience with Astro and AI-powered workflows. Tools accelerate the process. The judgment, attention to detail and responsibility stay with me.",
